= TrainerHill_Roof_EventScript_NewRecord
msgbox	Oh, hold on here! Did you possibly get here marvelously quickly?How splendid! You needn't have hurried so to see me!That is so delightful. I'll have the Time Board at the reception updated!
goto TrainerHill_Roof_EventScript_EndSpeakToOwner
end
